===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar}} {{term|شيعة|tr=shii`a|sc=Arab}} (''faction'')

===Alternative forms===
* [[Shia]]
* [[Shiah]]
* [[Shi'ah]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# The [[minority]] [[branch]] of [[Islam]] whose followers [[believe]] that [[Muhammad]] [[designate]]d his [[son-in-law]], [[Ali]], to [[succeed]] him as [[leader]], and that their leaders have [[special]] [[sacred]] [[wisdom]].
# One who follows Shi'ah Islam, a Shi'ite.

====Synonyms====
* {{qualifier|follower of Shi'ah Islam}}: [[Shiite]]

